- **Domain Utama Target:** https://www.vijeboutiqueresort.com / https://hotel.hasanarofid.site
- **Branch Utama:** `main` / `master`
- **Repository Git:** `git@github.com:hasanarofid/sistem-hotel.git`
- **Lisensi & Owner:** [@hasanarofid.site](https://hasanarofid.site) | WhatsApp: [Wa.me/628814959247](https://Wa.me/628814959247)

---

## 1. Peran, Identitas & Prinsip Utama AI Redesign

- **Peran AI:** Senior UI/UX Designer, Luxury Hospitality Website Designer, dan Senior Full-Stack Developer.
- **Tugas Utama:** REDESIGN VISUAL dan UX dari website existing ([www.vijeboutiqueresort.com](https://www.vijeboutiqueresort.com)) tanpa mengubah bisnis proses utama yang sudah berjalan.
- **Prinsip Utama (Final Design Principle):**
  > **"Less, but better."**  
  > Website harus memberikan kesan instan saat pertama dibuka: *"Ini resort luxury boutique premium"* — bukan *"Ini website template hotel generik"*.
  > Prioritas Hierarki: **Photography > Typography > Whitespace > Storytelling > CTA**.

---

## 2. Referensi Desain & Brand Direction

### Referensi Visual Standard:
- **Aman Resorts:** Minimal luxury, strong photography, calm atmosphere, nature connection, editorial typography, immersive storytelling.
- **Kempinski Hotels:** European luxury, elegant typography, premium hospitality, sophisticated layout, strong brand presence.

### Visual Identity: "Quiet Luxury Boutique Resort"
- **Karakter Visual:** Minimal, Elegant, Organic, Natural, Timeless, Premium, Editorial, Sophisticated.
- **Dilarang (Strictly Avoid):**
  - Gradient berlebihan / neon berisik (desain terlalu "AI").
  - Warna terlalu terang / ngejreng.
  - Card UI yang terlalu banyak & berderet kaku.
  - Border berlebihan & shadow berat.
  - Desain seperti OTA/travel booking aggregator (Agoda/Booking.com).
  - Layout corporate & template hotel murah.

---

## 3. Color Palette & Typography Guidelines

### Color Palette (Natural & Luxury)
- **Primary:** Warm Ivory (`#FAF8F5`), Cream (`#F4EFE6`), Sand (`#E6DEC9`), Warm Beige (`#D9CEB2`).
- **Secondary:** Deep Forest Green (`#1C2826`), Dark Olive (`#2B3023`), Charcoal (`#1A1A1A`).
- **Accent:** Muted Gold / Bronze (`#C5A059`).
- **Background:** Off White / Ivory (`#FDFBF7`) / Obsidian (`#121212` for dark sections).
- **Text:** Deep Charcoal (`#222222`).

### Typography Standard
- **Display / Heading:** Elegant Serif (`Cormorant Garamond` / `Playfair Display` / `Cinzel`).
- **Body / Subtitle:** Clean Modern Sans-Serif (`Plus Jakarta Sans` / `Inter` / `Manrope`).
- **Heading:** Large, elegant, spacious.
- **Body:** Clean, legible, editorial spacing.

---

## 4. Struktur Blueprint Redesign Homepage & Sections

1. **Full-screen Hero:**
   - Photography/Video resort resolusi tinggi, minimal navigation, logo, tagline elegant (*"Where Luxury Meets Serenity"*), booking CTA.
   - Micro-animation: Slow image zoom, fade-in typography, smooth transition.
2. **Editorial Introduction:**
   - Storytelling pengantar resort (*"An intimate retreat designed for those who appreciate the beauty of slow living"*). Large whitespace & supporting photo.
3. **Rooms & Villas Showcase:**
   - Editorial layout (bukan grid card biasa). 1 large featured accommodation + supporting accommodations. Detail: foto, nama, deskripsi, amenitas kunci, luas ($m^2$), kapasitas, CTA "Explore".
4. **Experience Section:**
   - Jual pengalaman eksklusif: Private dining, Spa & Wellness, Infinity pool, Sunset cruise, Local experiences.
5. **Dining Section:**
   - Editorial luxury restaurant view, signature dishes, private dining atmosphere, bar/lounge.
6. **Immersive Gallery:**
   - Editorial masonry / full-width photography layout seperti luxury travel magazine.
7. **Location & Storytelling:**
   - Peta interaktif elegan, jarak dari bandara, narasi keindahan lokasi resort.
8. **Testimonial:**
   - Minimalist quote typography dari tamu.
9. **Booking Conversion CTA:**
   - Section penuh daya pikat (*"Your Private Escape Awaits"*) + CTA *"Book Your Stay"*.
10. **Luxury Minimalist Footer & Navigation:**
    - Transparent navbar saat di top, berubah solid/light saat scroll. Mobile navigation berupa hamburger menu yang sangat premium.

---

## 5. Standar UX, Animasi, Performa & SEO

### UX & Conversion Strategy
- Navigasi intuitif, penempatan CTA *"Book Your Stay"* yang konsisten namun tidak agresif (Luxury feel).
- User dapat menemukan Overview, Rooms, Experience, Location, & Booking dalam hitungan detik.

### Subtle Luxury Animation
- Durasi transisi 400ms – 1000ms (Fade-up, image reveal, slow parallax, smooth hover).
- Dilarang: Bounce, excessive scaling, flashing, atau gerakan cepat yang merusak kesan *calm*.

### Performa & Mobile-First
- Perangkat Target: Mobile (390px/430px), Tablet, Laptop (1366px), Desktop (1440px/1920px).
- Image Optimization: WebP/AVIF, lazy loading, responsive srcset. Prioritas tinggi pada LCP Hero Image.

### SEO & Accessibility
- Semantic HTML (H1/H2/H3), Hotel/LocalBusiness Schema.org Structured Data, WCAG-friendly contrast ratio.

---

## 6. Prosedur Git & Deploy

1. Build frontend assets: `npm run build`
2. Push commit:
   ```bash
   git add .
   git commit -m "feat/redesign: update luxury boutique resort rules & architecture"
   git push origin master
   ```
